Obrii LoRa PHY

The packet-coding conventions in loracodec.cpp and the independent golden
symbol vector in loratest.cpp are adapted from/referenced against LoRaPHY:
https://github.com/jkadbear/LoRaPHY/blob/master/LoRaPHY.m
Copyright (C) 2020-2022 jkadbear, jkadbear@gmail.com
MIT license: LICENSE.LoRaPHY in this directory. Retain this notice and license
when redistributing this component, including in binary distributions.

Obrii additions include the C++17 API, bounded streaming receiver, error
reporting, FFT implementation and offline tool. No GNU Radio or MATLAB runtime
is linked or required. No gr-lora_sdr source is included in this component.
